/prompt-catalogue/

# The new daydream engine's bench output (`npm run dreams:bench`, docs/dreams.md):
# every prompt and generated passage in plain text, so it stays on this machine.
/dream-bench/
# Every model request and reply a dev server made (src/lib/server/dream-capture.ts).
/dream-log/

